    "sub_name": "個體經濟學",
    "sub_ename": "MICROECONOMICS",
    "describe_ch": "Focusing on the price impacts of consumer and firm in markets, the key microeconomic concepts and analytical techniques are introduced in this course. The students will also be exposed to various economic issues. \r\n\r\nHaving reinforced their appreciation of microeconomics in theory and in practice, students will be able to contemplate on the market interactions between producers and consumers, and in turn develop the ability to analyze the pros and cons of government intervention.\r\n\r\n",
