  "gradeRuleDescribe": {
    "yms_year": 114.0,
    "yms_smester": 2.0,
    "cls_id": "NM07120",
    "sub_id": "38550",
    "scr_dup": "001",
    "tpa_score_new": "<div>曠課1節扣1分。曠課10節，本評分項0分。全勤，本評分項10分。</div>\n\n<div>小考2次，取最高分者計算。</div>\n\n<div>期中考 30%。</div>\n\n<div>期末考 40%。</div>\n",
    "tpa_score_new_en": " ",
    "course_pol": "提醒同學在課堂上不准使用影印及盜版教材。上課期間在課堂上不得吃食，不得趴睡。若有需要智暫休息或進食，可以暫時離開教室，相關事宜若已完成或排除，應盡快返回課堂上課。\n\nStudents are not allowed to use pirated teaching materials in class. Students are not allowed to eat or sleep in the class. If needed, you can take a short break after permission.",
    "course_pol_en": "Students are not allowed to use pirated teaching materials in class. Students are not allowed to eat or sleep in class. If needed, you can take a short break after permission.\n課後作業習作、撰寫報告時，應信守誠實及榮譽原則。鼓勵同學於研習課程內容和進行章末習題習作時，可進行小組討論，相互砥勵，以提昇學習成效。",
    "course_rem": "希望同學能做好課前預習，課後溫習，學習成效加倍。\n\nA kindly reminder:\nBe sure to preview the course materials before class and review them after class to enhance learning effectiveness.",
    "course_rem_en": "A kind reminder:\nBe sure to preview the course materials before class and review them after class to enhance learning effectiveness.\n希望同學做好課前預習，課後溫習，學習成效加倍",
    "ais_meno": "<div>同學在參加小考測驗、期中考和期末考時，應信守誠實及榮譽原則。也鼓勵同學於研習課程內容和進行章末習題習作時，可進行小組討論，相互砥勵，以提昇學習成效。</div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div>\n<div>You should adhere to honesty and honor when doing homework and writing reports. Students are encouraged to discuss in groups and encourage each other when studying course content and doing end-of-chapter exercises to enhance learning outcomes.</div>\n</div>\n",
    "ais_meno_en": "<div>You should adhere to honesty and honor when doing homework and writing reports. Students are encouraged to discuss course content in groups and support one another when completing end-of-chapter exercises to enhance their learning outcomes. 做作業和寫報告時，應秉持誠實守信的原則。鼓勵學生分組討論課程內容，並在完成章末練習時互相幫助，以提升學習效果。</div>\n",
    "ilearn_mk": "N"
  },
